{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01660","headline":"杂曲歌辞 前有一尊酒行二首 一 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 前有一尊酒行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风东来忽相过，金尊绿酒生微波。\n落花纷纷稍觉多，美人欲醉朱颜酡。\n青轩桃李能几何？流光欺人忽蹉跎。\n君起舞，日西夕，当年意气不肯倾，白发如丝叹何益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}